  "caption": "The video shows a plastic building-block structure on a wooden surface against a pale wooden backdrop. A wavy cyan platform rests on six evenly spaced vertical yellow columns, with short gray dominoes standing upright along its top edge. To the right, upright gray dominoes line the ground; to the left, a low row sits beside a transparent panel. The scene is nearly still, then the leftmost yellow column bends and buckles, the left end of the cyan platform dips and separates, and the column collapses onto the surface, scattering cyan and gray pieces leftward into a growing debris pile. The failure moves rightward as the second column leans, buckles, and falls, dragging down the adjacent platform and toppling the gray dominoes above it leftward. A third column also leans and falls, while the rightmost columns remain upright and the right domino row stays in place. The structure is still mid-collapse, with the sagging platform and debris settling.",
